<title>BELGIUM: BBL/VERMEULEN RAISES QUICK TO HOLD.</title>
<headline>BBL/VERMEULEN RAISES QUICK TO HOLD.</headline>
<dateline>BRUSSELS 1997-05-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>Summary of research report - </p>
<p>Co name-----------Sector------Price------Broker-------------</p>
<p>Quick fast food   1,770 * BBL/Vermeulen-Raemdonck</p>
<p>COMMENT: Shares upgraded to hold from sell following company</p>
<p>contact. News about company is improving but not yet brilliant.</p>
<p>Earnings per share forecast may be revised after May 14 annual</p>
<p>shareholders meeting, where more details expected on recent</p>
<p>performance. Share remains expensive but downside risk seems</p>
<p>limited after 50 percent drop in last 12 months.</p>
<p>Recommendation: HOLD. (*) Date of research report: 30/04/97</p>
<p> Estimates:   EPS	  pvs est   P/E     Dividend</p>
<p> 1996	    79 BFR    n/a	 22.4    33 BFR</p>
<p> 1997	    93 BFR    n/a	 19.0    33 BFR</p>
<p> 1998	   103 BFR    n/a	 17.2    36 BFR</p>
